BUNDLED FONTS

Two typefaces are redistributed with this repository, both under the SIL Open
Font License 1.1, which permits bundling and embedding:

  Open Sans, in `client/src/assets/fonts/`, served to the website.
  Copyright 2020 The Open Sans Project Authors
  https://github.com/googlefonts/opensans

  Liberation Serif, subset into `client/src/lib/book-fonts-data.ts` and embedded
  in the exported PDF. Copyright (c) 2012 Red Hat, Inc. with Reserved Font Name
  Liberation. Digitized data copyright (c) 2010 Google Corporation with Reserved
  Font Name Arimo, Tinos and Cousine.

The full text of the SIL Open Font License 1.1 is at
